                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Australia's largest medical imaging network came to us in 2015. The brief: replace outdated, uncomfortable uniforms across a national workforce. The solution: a complete end-to-end program designed around the people wearing it. Clinical and non-clinical. Every role considered.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "normal",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_RAGdEQ"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_gHYCdz": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Our Custom Uniform Solution",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_wCK9yV": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>A uniform program is only as strong as its details. For I-MED, we designed a small collection of bespoke pieces that made the brand unmistakable — without overpowering it.<br/>A lightweight chiffon scarf in a soft gradient of I-MED's colours. A woven striped tie for the menswear range. A custom orange belt. A women's keyhole blouse in I-MED orange. Ownable. Considered. Distinctly I-MED.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "normal",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_wCK9yV"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_rwKWhT": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "I-MED's Ready-Wear Solution",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_PEx76n": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>The backbone of the program. Styles selected for the pace of healthcare — practical, polished and built for long shifts.<br/>DTY scrubs: breathable, pocket-loaded and an instant favourite. Mini check shirts for a touch of personality. Smart French navy bottoms that paired with everything.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_PEx76n"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_bTjE7i": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "How We Delivered",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_wzmrNB": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>A network this size required precision. A customised online portal gave I-MED full control — ordering, tracking, managing, all in one place. Smart stock management balanced custom pieces with ready-wear. And when the program launched, we didn't disappear. We're still there.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_wzmrNB"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_YzyQGw": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Services Provided",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_pbzzEU": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Bespoke fabric colour and prints. Dedicated account manager. Customised online portal. Warehousing, fulfilment and stock management. National roadshow with personal styling and fitting. Made-for-you uniform service. Digital and printed uniform catalogue.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
